      "category": "service",
      "expected_impact": "Enhanced customer interactions, improved staff morale, and a more welcoming dining experience."
    },
    {
      "priority": 3,
      "issue": "Outdated decor, poor lighting, uncomfortable seating, or excessive noise levels.",
      "action": "Allocate budget for a phased refresh of the dining area, starting with improved lighting, comfortable seating upgrades, and sound-dampening solutions (e.g., acoustic panels, soft furnishings).",
      "category": "operations",
      "expected_impact": "A more pleasant and inviting dining environment, encouraging longer stays and positive word-of-mouth."
    },
    {
      "priority": 4,
      "issue": "Menu prices not aligning with perceived value, portion sizes, or quality of food/service.",
