      "category": "pricing",
      "expected_impact": "Increased customer perception of value for money, potentially leading to higher sales and reduced price-related complaints."
    },
    {
      "priority": 5,
      "issue": "Inadequate cleaning protocols, insufficient staff for cleaning, or lack of regular maintenance.",
      "action": "Develop and enforce a detailed daily, weekly, and monthly cleaning checklist for all areas (kitchen, dining room, restrooms). Assign specific staff responsibilities and conduct daily spot checks by management.",
